un appartamento e che si deciderà, affascinata da quella strana figura, a uscire dal suo eremitaggio metropolitano.","language":"it-IT"},"tagline":{"value":"Una volta nella vita, arriva un momento in cui vivi nella SPERANZA.","language":"it-IT"},"releaseDate":"2009-05-14","status":"Released","rating":7.905,"ratingCount":759,"genres":["Dramma","Commedia","Romance"],"countries":["South Korea"],"facts":{"Runtime":"116m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":83682,"name":"Jung Jae-young","role":"Mr. Kim","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xeiFPl5GOHemLGGMpvzeiK0Nlpm.jpg"},{"id":108535,"name":"Jung Ryeo-won","role":"Kim Jung-yeon","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lwpxoITReDuadSr5beFZ3xmxuIQ.jpg"},{"id":1253449,"name":"Yang Mi-kyung","role":"Jung-yeon's Mother","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3vmMmJw9dYHa9VZRsVaG6WEqQbF.jpg"},{"id":2125944,"name":"Lee Sang-hoon","role":"Seung-geun's Father","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/46uvc12KfscjPChJYidQX8grNF4.jpg"},{"id":463583,"name":"Jang So-yeon","role":"Seung-geun's Girlfriend","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f6P6S8MIVAsoyzuqvT63DF1iahy.jpg"},{"id":1410299,"name":"Park Young-seo","role":"Delivery Man","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yBRpXWDK32hPVNX7fvO4zNB2b5n.jpg"},{"id":1096458,"name":"Koo Kyo-hwan","role":"Public Service Employee","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aFwCpSKPGFqoiTStY6ljXnD5CwH.jpg"},{"id":2976928,"name":"Lee Kyung-joon","role":"High School Kim"},{"id":145955,"name":"Min Kyung-jin","role":"APT Security","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aBdDqgQRHFeRaOopIrSG8aToE0V.jpg"},{"id":2500987,"name":"Jang Nam-yeol","role":"Bus Driver","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oT9BNZLImFHky9mQANqKutcOezQ.jpg"},{"id":1916075,"name":"Lee Kyoo-hyung","role":"119 (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8F7s9MNKfks21VMTsW8iTc9VK09.jpg"},{"id":3128339,"name":"Im Dong-yoon","role":"Cruise Ship","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dRHrC5ssyhy3qspQhJVwYPKKoaT.jpg"},{"id":138521,"name":"Kim Hee-chang","role":"Marine","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7zLM9KCSWOoXBiDIycfv57EEC4j.jpg"},{"id":3121991,"name":"Ri Min","role":"Motorcycle","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tZNzpUQBOjN4DI0n0fFf77Wy4Se.jpg"},{"id":3575157,"name":"Jeong Ji-hye","role":"Shoes"},{"id":4050539,"name":"Son Seon-geun","role":"Interviewer","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dbbw6XX9VB8l5KhnyH573yJyiCt.jpg"},{"id":3172379,"name":"Won Chang-yeon","role":"Interviewer"},{"id":2886794,"name":"Hong Min-hee","role":"Kim's mother"},{"id":6368665,"name":"Guk Ji-yeon","role":"Fantasy girl"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Castaway on the Moon","overview":"Kim è un uomo disperato. Al punto che un giorno decide di saltare da uno dei più alti ponti di Seul sul fiume Han. Ma il tentato suicidio fallisce e Kim si ritrova il mattino dopo su un'isoletta in mezzo al fiume. Nonostante la città sia tutt'intorno, Kim non sa nuotare e non riesce a farsi notare da nessuno. Deve rassegnarsi a fare il naufrago, nutrendosi di funghi. Lo noterà, guardando dalla finestra con un cannocchiale, una donna che vive da anni segregata volontariamente in un appartamento e che si deciderà, affascinata da quella strana figura, a uscire dal suo eremitaggio metropolitano.","tagline":"Una volta nella vita, arriva un momento in cui vivi nella SPERANZA."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Castaway on the Moon","overview":"Mr. Kim is jobless, lost in debt and has been dumped by his girlfriend. He decides to end it all by jumping into the Han River – only to find himself washed up on a small, mid-river island. He soon abandons thoughts of suicide or rescue and begins a new life as a castaway. His antics catch the attention of a young woman whose apartment overlooks the river. Her discovery changes both their lives.","tagline":"Once in a life time, There comes a moment that you live in HOPE."},{"language":"ko-KR","title":"김씨 표류기","overview":"자살시도가 실패로 끝나 한강의 밤섬에 불시착한 남자. 죽는 것도 쉽지 않자 일단 섬에서 살아보기로 한다. 모래사장에 쓴 HELP가 HELLO로 바뀌고 무인도 야생의 삶도 살아볼 만하다고 느낄 무렵, 익명의 쪽지가 담긴 와인병을 발견하고 그의 삶은 알 수 없는 희망으로 설레기 시작한다. 한편 자신의 좁고 어두운 방이 온 지구이자 세상인 여자. 홈페이지 관리, 하루 만보 달리기 등 그녀만의 생활리듬도 있다. 유일한 취미인 달사진 찍기에 열중하던 어느 날, 저 멀리 한강의 섬에서 낯선 모습을 발견하고 그에게 리플을 달아주기로 하는 그녀는 3년 만에 자신의 방을 벗어나 그를 향해 달려가는데...","tagline":"사는게 모험이지"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lxUysvJKrmS0115vvSP7lqJ3LmV.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lxUysvJKrmS0115vvSP7lqJ3LmV.png","language":"en","width":756,"height":133},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wF3KwUdtO0T0CPJLcStvvPTbCmb.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wF3KwUdtO0T0CPJLcStvvPTbCmb.png","language":"ko","width":786,"height":286}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ya7kf9AWA3Dd5aTD0uvrLxqq6zX.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ya7kf9AWA3Dd5aTD0uvrLxqq6zX.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ph90ySAOuZTQM5e3YJ4sAqR8QSP.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ph90ySAOuZTQM5e3YJ4sAqR8QSP.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gGzovvmOEyNVUu4WEHtw9wfDsqI.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gGzovvmOEyNVUu4WEHtw9wfDsqI.jpg","language":"en","width":660,"height":990},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wVDuDqn4ZPIhfdr7gyS2dKE0XPl.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wVDuDqn4ZPIhfdr7gyS2dKE0XPl.jpg","language":"en","width":800,"height":1200},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4dQ6ynrd9dFypbWCn0cco88ihXI.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4dQ6ynrd9dFypbWCn0cco88ihXI.jpg","language":"